---
import ContentLayout from '@layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@config/site';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles data. Our calculators run entirely in your browser, so the values you enter stay on your device and are never sent to a server.`}
  path="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="2026-07-17"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} ("we", "us") handles information when
    you use our website. We designed the site to collect as little as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Calculations stay on your device</h2>
  <p>
    Our calculators run entirely in your web browser. The numbers and values you enter
    into any calculator are processed locally and are <strong>not</strong> transmitted
    to or stored on our servers.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We may collect limited, non-identifying analytics data — such as pages viewed,
    approximate region, browser type and referring site — to understand how the site
    is used and to improve it. We do not use this data to identify individuals.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may use cookies for basic functionality and analytics. If we introduce
    advertising, third-party ad providers (such as Google) may use cookies to serve
    ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of
    personalized advertising through Google's Ads Settings and via
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    Some third-party services we use (for example, analytics or advertising providers)
    may collect information in accordance with their own privacy policies. We encourage
    you to review those policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Our site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
    personal information from them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings, and use browser
    privacy features at any time. Doing so will not affect the core functionality of
    our calculators.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by
    the "last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
